3. Check for pairs: For each unique number on the cards, we will check if it appears exactly twice. If any number appears other than twice, we cannot form the required pairs, so we will output -1.
4. Form pairs: If all numbers appear twice, we will form pairs by taking the indices of the cards with the same number and output them as pairs.
